---
description: Use Istra MCP as the only durable project-memory path in Cursor.
alwaysApply: true
---

Istra is the only durable project-memory path. Do not bypass its MCP tools through REST, direct SQLite access, or a second tracker.

Use `client: "cursor-plugin:istra"` on every write, including error reports and automation calls.

Follow `istra-project-memory` for resolve → pulse → work → evidence → checkpoint. Follow `istra-error-reporting` for Istra MCP, plugin, instruction, or workflow faults only.

Do not block a clearly scoped task on bookkeeping.
